flowchart TB
  U[Customer request + auth context] --> V[Authorize scope and validate input]
  V --> T[MAF C# Intent Executor]
  T --> S[MAF Tool: Catalog read-only search]
  S --> O[MAF Tool: Offer/stock/shipping read-only]
  O --> C[MAF Comparison Executor]
  C --> R[Grounded recommendation with IDs, timestamps, TTL]
  R --> D{Customer requests cart change?}
  D -- No --> Z[Display recommendation / links]
  D -- Yes --> P[Create INERT cart proposal]
  P --> H{Trusted Next.js explicit approval?}
  H -- No/Expired --> X[No mutation]
  H -- Yes --> B[Server validates subject + nonce + payload hash]
  B -->|Authorized| CART[Call Cart ASP.NET Core owner]
  B -->|Denied| X
  CART --> CH[Redirect to normal checkout; requote]
  V -.-> F[Model unavailable: normal search fallback]
  R -.-> F
